<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><title>Oort NX</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/"/><link rel="self" href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/feed.xml"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/</id><updated>2026-11-25T12:00:00Z</updated><author><name>Oort NX</name></author><entry><title>Oort NX 0.5.0-beta.3 — Easier to read, more yours</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.5.0-beta.3/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.5.0-beta.3/</id><updated>2026-11-25T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The controller in dots&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;It lights what you press, in Settings › Controllers, Controls and Players.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;macOS settings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Increase Contrast and Reduce Transparency are followed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Better&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sentences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Labels are no longer in capitals, in all seven languages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Readable over art&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The outline has a dark edge and the art darkens behind text.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;27 palettes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Text at 4.5:1 and shapes at 3:1 everywhere.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Colors, spaces, radii and motion come from the same tokens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Fixed&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot fixed&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;exFAT and FAT32 drives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read as full, they refused mods and saves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot fixed&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add a game&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The steps stayed in English in other languages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Coming from 0.3.0&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Install this DMG once: 0.3.0 cannot move to the new identity by itself. After that, updates are automatic again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On first launch your library is copied and every file checked. The old one is not modified. Do not open both versions at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sign in to your services and grant the macOS permissions once more. No game to recompile.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Not tried yet&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated tests pass. The controller changes with a real controller, a real game launch, a real Google Drive transfer and another Mac were not tried with this version. Keep a copy of what matters to you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Install&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;macOS 26 or later, Apple silicon. The app is not signed by Apple: the first time, use System Settings › Privacy &amp;amp; Security › Open Anyway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;files&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;file&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sofianbll/oort-nx/releases/download/v0.5.0-beta.3/Oort-NX-0.5.0-beta.3.dmg&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 4v10.500m-4.700-4.200 4.700 4.500 4.700-4.500M5 19.500h14&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mac&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oort-NX-0.5.0-beta.3.dmg · 59 MB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;sha&quot; data-sha=&quot;55b37f11f063c49323a280178598520ae3debbed3dc4bc63f76b9aa956f376ac&quot; data-done=&quot;Copied&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;8.500&quot; y=&quot;8.500&quot; width=&quot;11&quot; height=&quot;11&quot; rx=&quot;2.500&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M15.500 5.500a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;Copy the checksum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Oort NX 0.5.0-beta.2 — Compose, place by place</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.5.0-beta.2/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.5.0-beta.2/</id><updated>2026-11-25T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compose by place&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Games, Ribbon, Players and Lists have their own sequence. The rest follow Everywhere.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ZL and ZR everywhere&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;First and last in options, details, search, mods, cheats, saves, themes and files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A presses in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The button, row or tile moves as it does under a click.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Better&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One outline&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;It glides from game to game on the home screen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Same surfaces&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;First-launch cards, detail links and dialogs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Fixed&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot fixed&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First launch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rows without a description are centered.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot fixed&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Sun&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;It no longer shows through “Add”.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Coming from 0.3.0&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Install this DMG once: 0.3.0 cannot move to the new identity by itself. After that, updates are automatic again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On first launch your library is copied and every file checked. The old one is not modified. Do not open both versions at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sign in to your services and grant the macOS permissions once more. No game to recompile.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Not tried yet&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated tests pass, but no real Google Drive transfer, no real game launch, no real controller on the new gestures and no other Mac were tried with this version. Keep a copy of what matters to you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Install&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;macOS 26 or later, Apple silicon. The app is not signed by Apple: the first time, use System Settings › Privacy &amp;amp; Security › Open Anyway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;files&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;file&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sofianbll/oort-nx/releases/download/v0.5.0-beta.2/Oort-NX-0.5.0-beta.2.dmg&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 4v10.500m-4.700-4.200 4.700 4.500 4.700-4.500M5 19.500h14&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mac&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oort-NX-0.5.0-beta.2.dmg · 59 MB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;sha&quot; data-sha=&quot;9ea58d5267f4c12c581f846d1502249c39c0031b87d529edc0b1f827ec353e2d&quot; data-done=&quot;Copied&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;8.500&quot; y=&quot;8.500&quot; width=&quot;11&quot; height=&quot;11&quot; rx=&quot;2.500&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M15.500 5.500a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;Copy the checksum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Oort NX 0.5.0-beta.1 — The first, in its own home</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.5.0-beta.1/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.5.0-beta.1/</id><updated>2026-11-25T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Oort cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;It lives behind the library, drawn by the graphics chip.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Four voices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Oort, Pollen, Umbra and Impulsion, made by the app. Notes climb as you move.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interface size&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;From 80 to 125%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Players&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Seats, controllers and who is playing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Controller layouts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Short Home, long Home, + and Y. The earlier layout stays available.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optional, with your Google Drive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Better&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tidy settings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;A sidebar of subjects, a search, and a full page for each game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Four tabs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;All games, Installed, Cloud and Favorites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The site’s pieces in the app&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Buttons, switches, sliders, panels and dialogs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;A held direction repeats, the right stick scrolls fast, L3 opens search.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Coming from 0.3.0&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Install this DMG once: 0.3.0 cannot move to the new identity by itself. After that, updates are automatic again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On first launch your library is copied and every file checked. The old one is not modified. Do not open both versions at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sign in to your services and grant the macOS permissions once more. No game to recompile.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Not tried yet&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated tests pass, but no real Google Drive transfer, no real game launch, no real controller on the new gestures and no other Mac were tried with this version. Keep a copy of what matters to you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Install&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;macOS 26 or later, Apple silicon. The app is not signed by Apple: the first time, use System Settings › Privacy &amp;amp; Security › Open Anyway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Oort NX 0.3.0 — Arcane becomes Oort NX</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.3.0/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.3.0/</id><updated>2026-11-23T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Oort theme&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dark by default if no theme was chosen, with two icons: Halftone or Particles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The game display&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Choose the display your games open on, for all of them or just one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Better&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interrupted transfers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The reason and “Resume” stay visible after the alert.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full disk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The volume is named and the original copy kept.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;A confirmation before an installed app is replaced.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Fixed&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot fixed&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One reason, once&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The cloud panel no longer repeats a failure already shown.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Good to know&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recompile Pokémon Legends: Z-A so that the + button goes straight to the game. Choosing the display also needs a game compiled with a compatible engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;</content></entry></feed>